description:
Add CLI transcript-style tests for the guided character creation experience.

Scenarios
- successful concept-first level-1 character;
- successful ability-first level-1 character;
- invalid class with correction;
- invalid ancestry with correction;
- point-buy out-of-range score rejected immediately;
- non-integer score rejected immediately;
- missing name after revision is caught without losing other answers;
- HP waits for prerequisites;
- save/resume;
- review shows missing choices.

Acceptance criteria
- Tests exercise the CLI shell separately from pure engine tests where practical.
- Error-message assertions focus on stable actionable content, not brittle formatting.
- Tests are deterministic and do not rely on LLM output.
